('APX-C-3866', '3866', 'Warm Evening Atmosphere at a Cozy Street Restaurant', 'Warm evening atmosphere at a cozy street restaurant. The girl sits with her friends, laughing softly while finishing dinner. Ambient lights glow, plates and drinks on the table. CameYra slowly pans, capturing genuine expressions and lively surroundings.', 16, null, 'https://x.com/soulful__ai/status/2049538403029721207', 'Scene 1 (0–4s):
