('APX-S-3916-1', 'APX-C-3916', 1, null, null, null, 'A high-quality cinematic video of a teenage girl performing a basketball freestyle routine, strictly following a structured 16-step choreography sequence (4x4 grid timing) over 10 seconds total duration. Character: A slim, athletic teenage girl with the same face and identity as the provided reference image (must remain consistent throughout the video). She has a slightly nerdy, awkward-cool charm, soft pale skin with light freckles, expressive eyes, and slightly messy light-toned hair tied loosely.', null, null, 'She has a slightly nerdy, awkward-cool charm, soft pale skin with light freckles, expressive eyes, and slightly messy light-toned hair tied loosely.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3916-2', 'APX-C-3916', 2, null, null, null, 'She wears thin-frame glasses and a modern street basketball outfit: oversized jersey, loose shorts, crew socks, and high-top sneakers with subtle pastel accents (soft purple and light blue). Her personality feels shy-but-confident, revealing high-level freestyle skills. Environment: Minimal indoor basketball court studio. Clean wooden court floor with subtle markings, soft diffused lighting, light neutral walls, no distractions. Slight depth-of-field for a polished editorial sports look.', null, null, 'She wears thin-frame glasses and a modern street basketball outfit: oversized jersey, loose shorts, crew socks, and high-top sneakers with subtle pastel accents (soft purple and light blue).', null, null, null, null, 'studio', null),
('APX-S-3916-3', 'APX-C-3916', 3, null, null, null, 'Style & Motion: Smooth, controlled freestyle basketball flow. Natural body mechanics, realistic dribbling physics, fluid transitions between moves. Slight stylized cinematic feel but grounded in realism. Camera: Mostly medium full-body framing, slight dynamic tracking and subtle handheld feel. Occasional micro-zooms and angle shifts to enhance motion. Keep subject centered and clearly visible at all times. ⸻ ⏱️ STRICT SEQUENCE (must follow exactly in order and timing) Each move flows continuously into the next with no cuts: Right-hand low dribble (controlled stance) Behind-the-back transfer (right → left) Quick crossover (left → right) Between-the-legs dribble Hesitation dribble (pause + fake shift) Behind-the-back (reverse side) Smooth 360° spin move (left direction) Ball spin on finger (brief controlled balance) Behind-the-back into crossover combo Step-back motion with dribble Fake pass (upper body feint) Around-the-world ball motion Behind-the-back + step-through footwork Behind + crossover combo (tight control) Quick low rapid dribble sequence Stylish finish pose (confident stance, slight smile, holding ball) ⸻ 🎯 Key Constraints: The routine must strictly follow the exact step order (1–16) Total duration: ~10 seconds (fast but readable transitions) Ball must remain physically accurate and consistent in motion No skipped or merged steps No extra tricks beyond listed sequence Character face must remain identical to reference throughout (no drift) Maintain consistent outfit, proportions, and style ⸻ 🎨 Visual Details: Soft pastel accents in outfit subtly visible Natural shadows and lighting consistency Clean, minimal aesthetic (no clutter) Slight motion trails or subtle emphasis can be added to highlight movement flow', null, null, 'Style & Motion: Smooth, controlled freestyle basketball flow. Natural body mechanics, dribbling physics, fluid transitions between moves. Slight stylized feel but grounded in realism. Occasional micro- and angle shifts to enhance motion.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3945-1', 'APX-C-3945', 1, null, null, null, 'Urban Freestyle Sequence (16 Steps, Night Alley) [PROJECT TYPE] Cinematic urban dance video (freestyle precision with structured sequence) [CORE REQUIREMENT — STRICT] The video must follow the exact 16-step movement sequence below in the same order. No steps added, removed, or rearranged. Each movement flows naturally into the next with clean transitions. 🧍‍♀️ [CHARACTER] Female street dancer (urban / performance aesthetic) Lean, athletic build Same consistent face and proportions throughout Confident, grounded presence Movement style: controlled, expressive, rhythm-driven 👕 [WARDROBE — URBAN STYLE] Oversized hoodie Cargo pants Chunky sneakers Subtle accessories (chain or wristband) Fabric behavior: Heavy cotton folds, natural motion drag, realistic cloth physics 📍 [LOCATION / ENVIRONMENT] Empty neon-lit alley (Asian urban aesthetic, not limited to Korea) Environment details: Wet pavement reflections Soft neon signage glow Concrete textures, depth perspective No people, no traffic Lighting: Night setting Neon accents (blue, pink, purple tones) Soft reflections on ground 🔢 [16-STEP MOVEMENT SEQUENCE — LOCKED] Idle Bounce Start Right Groove Step Left Groove Step Shoulder Roll Combo Slow Body Wave Down Back Glide Step Half Turn Slide Head Whip Accent Side Lean Drag Cross Step Pivot Body Wave Up Hip Bounce Loop Step Tap Combo Arm Swing Hit Chest Hit Accent Freeze End Pose (hold) 🎥 [CAMERA DIRECTION] Full-body framing maintained throughout Start: centered wide shot Smooth tracking (slight lateral + forward motion) Subtle handheld realism (very controlled) Gentle angle shifts during turns (front → slight side) ⚠️ No hard cuts — continuous cinematic flow 💃 [MOVEMENT STYLE — IMPORTANT] Urban freestyle with musical groove Deep bounce and rhythm control Smooth transitions between steps Strong accents on hits (Step 8, 14, 15) Clean isolations (shoulders, chest, hips) Balanced footwork, grounded stance No robotic motion, no unnatural speed ⏱️ [TIMING] Each step: ~2–3 seconds Total duration: ~35–50 seconds Smooth timing continuity 🎵 [MUSIC DIRECTION — VERY IMPORTANT] Genre: Lo-fi hip-hop / chill trap Tempo: 85–100 BPM Style: Deep bass Soft hi-hats Ambient synth layers Sync Notes: Groove steps match beat bounce Step 8 (Head Whip) hits a sharp snare/accent Step 15 (Chest Hit) aligns with bass drop Final freeze lands on beat fade 🎨 [VISUAL STYLE] Photorealistic with stylized neon mood High contrast highlights + soft shadows Cinematic color grading (cool tones) Moody, atmospheric look ⚙️ [OUTPUT SETTINGS] 4K resolution 24 FPS High motion clarity Clean rendering, no artifacts 🚫 [RESTRICTIONS] No extra dancers No crowd or vehicles No outfit changes No choreography deviation No jump cuts or broken continuity', null, null, 'Urban Freestyle Sequence (16 Steps, Night Alley) [PROJECT TYPE] urban dance video (freestyle precision with structured sequence) [CORE REQUIREMENT — STRICT] The video must follow the exact 16-step movement sequence below in the same order.', null, 'leaping; sliding', null, null, 'alley', 'calm'),
